        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4042, 2 x 10 Arched Style Narrow Trim Patio Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 x 10 Sandcast Bronze Arched Stretto Patio Door Trim is great for use on narrow trim patio doors that are not setup for multi-point trim locks. The Arched Style Narrow Trim Patio Lockset works with a tubular latch and is available in a keyed entry function and a double dummy function. The Sandcast Bronze Arched 2 x 10 Stretto Trim is made out of sandcast bronze and is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The rustic appearance that is achieved from the sandcasting process makes this Narrow Trim Handleset a great choice for farmhouses and cottages. Choose from a wide array of trim knobs and levers for a custom look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStretto Narrow Trim Locksets use a tubular latch. This patio door lock requires a 1-1/4\" diamater bore hole and a 2-hole door preparation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Arched Style Stretto Style Narrow Trim Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 3 please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4042-specifications.pdf?v=1704262364\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 4442 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Fixed inactive levers both sides of door. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nChoose any of the different knobs or levers to complete your handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 x 10 Sandcast Bronze Arched Stretto Patio Door Trim",
                "description": "The 2 x 10 Sandcast Bronze Arched Stretto Patio Door Trim is great for use on narrow trim patio doors that are not setup for multi-point trim locks. The Arched Style Narrow Trim Patio Lockset works with a tubular latch and is available in a keyed entry function and a double dummy function. The Sandcast Bronze Arched 2 x 10 Stretto Trim is made out of sandcast bronze and is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The rustic appearance that is achieved from the sandcasting process makes this Narrow Trim Handleset a great choice for farmhouses and cottages. Choose from a wide array of trim knobs and levers for a custom look.\r\n",
